/마을5의 대장장이
# 1
# 8
# 1
# "Blacksmith"
# BASIC
# 100
@ IF ITEM HAVE 213 THEN GO_DOWN 개골차1
@ IF NUM HAVE 105 THEN GO_DOWN 도둑1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "Hello. I sell weapons, and repair them here."
@ TALK "How can I help you?"
@ WAIT
* 사주대장장이
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "Select a weapon" GO_DOWN 장비고르기2
CASE "Sell a weapon" GO_DOWN 장비팔기
CASE "Repair a weapon" GO_DOWN 장비수리
CASE "Talking" GO_DOWN T5-1
CASE "<Exit>" GO_DOWN 끝
SELECT_END

@ END

* T5-1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "<Talking about the underworld>" GO_DOWN T5-1A
CASE "<Talking about Satan's lieutenants>" GO_DOWN T5-1B
CASE "<Talking about Raegios's family>" GO_DOWN T5-1C
CASE ""
CASE "<Stop talking>" GO_UP 사주대장장이
SELECT_END
@ END

* T5-1A
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "How did you enter the underworld?"
@ TALK "Obviously something covers the underworld." 
@ TALK "Only Raegios's family knows the secret of how to leave."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "<What's the reason you are here?>" GO_DOWN T5-1A-1
SELECT_END
@ END

* T5-1A-1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "Do you want to know why I'm here?"
@ TALK "Devils in the underworld are"
@ TALK "preparing themselves" 
@ TALK "for the fight again humans..."
@ TALK "Many people were kidnapped and brought down here."
@ TALK "The devils have learned fighting skills from them."
@ TALK "The devils wanted to learn from humans..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "We were their prisoners...We were promised"
@ TALK "our lives in exchange for our word that" 
@ TALK "we would teach them our skills..."
@ TALK ""
@ TALK "We also... got offered favors from them" 
@ TALK "for our help."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "It was a good decision for us facing death as we did."
@ TALK "It was help them or die."
@ TALK "We have nothing to say if you misunderstand us..."
@ WAIT
@ GO_UP T5-1
@ END

* T5-1B
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "The Devil..."
@ TALK "No-one may talk about the name of Satan here,"
@ TALK "in the underworld..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Do you know that the Devil and the demon hunters" 
@ TALK "fought bitterly in the last demon wars?"
@ TALK "He faced a crisis because some of his devils helped"
@ TALK "the hunters escape."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Finally... he was defeated and trapped"
@ TALK "in the underworld."
@ TALK "But now... his demons have inherited the Devil's power"
@ TALK "and have prepared themselves"
@ TALK "for the fight against humanity..."  
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "The underworld is in confusion."
@ TALK "I wonder what his four war-lords are plotting?"      
@ TALK "They have kept to themselves..."
@ TALK "Strangely they only send a few devils into our world..."
@ TALK "the rest of them remain down here."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "I think that the two sides may attack each other"
@ TALK "as soon as only a few devils are left"
@ TALK "in the underworld." 
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "And... this is a secret..." 
@ TALK "The Devil... reclaimed the Sword from the world..."
@ TALK "It's Shadow Sword"
@ TALK "Now... Blood will cover the underworld..."
@ WAIT
@ GO_UP T5-1
@ END

* T5-1C
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "You ask... I can tell you about Raegios's family."
@ TALK "They were powerful... but then a spell"
@ TALK "was cast upon them..."
@ TALK "and they lost all their power. They are miserable..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "The witch Raedina and the wizard Raegios are under"
@ TALK "this spell cast by Western demon and Eastern demon."
@ TALK "It was a cruel blow of fate..."
@ TALK "They were our spokesmen..."
@ WAIT
@ GO_UP T5-1
@ END

* 도둑1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Hey! Host!"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "Oh...You must be a devil hunter..."
@ TALK "What can I do for you? Do you want to buy weapons?"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Have you heard about the devils emerging around"
@ TALK "Devil's Tomb?"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "What are you talking about?"
@ TALK "This is news to me!!"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Oh... Are you sure no-one knows?"
@ TALK "It's lucky I came to warn you...!"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "What... what's happening?"
@ TALK "What else do you know?"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "I'm here to tell you that devils will come here"
@ TALK "for revenge..."
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "Is that true?"
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Please... tell everyone it's true."
@ TALK "It's a very urgent that they know this!"
@ TALK "Then they can prepare to defend themselves..."
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "Hey! Wait a minute!!"
@ TALK "Please...listen to me!!"
@ TALK "I have an idea... I have this bow you could use..."
@ TALK "I didn't think this would happen...I need your help..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Please fight the demons for us!!"
@ TALK "I'll give you the bow... Could you deal with"
@ TALK "the angry devils?"
@ TALK "And take this money... it's for your help!!"
@ GIVE MONEY 5000
@ TALK "5,000 gold pieces..."
@ TALK "Please take it and help us!!"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "It'd be better if I went and hid in the mountains..."
@ TALK "You are my savior..."
@ TALK "the only one I believe can help me!"
@ REMOVE NUM_TO_ALL 105
@ GIVE ITEM 55 1
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "So stupid... It was a lie." 
@ TALK "It'd be better to go back to the devils again."
@ WAIT
@ END

* 개골차1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Hello, I'm here with tea leaves from Bear Village."
@ WAIT

@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "Oh... You brought the tea leaves!"
@ TALK "Thank you!!"
@ TALK "I did ask for some. They're so hard to get these days."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "By the way...how much did I say I'd give you...?"
@ TALK "5,000gold pieces? 6,000gold pieces...?"
@ TALK "Maybe...7,000gold pieces! Now which was it?"
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "<5000 Gold pieces>" GO_DOWN 개골차1-1
CASE "<6000 Gold pieces>" GO_DOWN 개골차1-2
CASE "<7000 Gold pieces>" GO_DOWN 개골차1-3
SELECT_END

* 개골차1-1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "I can't remember what I said..."
@ TALK "You are reliable bringing them through such dangers..."
@ TALK "But I don't know you well.. You could cheat me..."
@ TALK "But it's great to get the tea!"
@ TALK "I'll give you...7,000gold pieces!"
@ GIVE MONEY 7000
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Please keep my honesty in your mind!"
@ TALK "Thank you for delivering my tea leaves!"
@ REMOVE ITEM 213
@ REMOVE NUM_TO_ALL 108
@ REMOVE_ORDER 54
@ WAIT
@ END

* 개골차1-2
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "I'm not sure what I said...?"
@ TALK "Hmm... It might be 5,000gold pieces..."
@ TALK "Anyway... I'll give you 6,000gold pieces!"
@ GIVE MONEY 6000
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Thank you for the tea leaves!"
@ REMOVE ITEM 213
@ REMOVE NUM_TO_ALL 108
@ REMOVE_ORDER 54
@ WAIT
@ END

* 개골차1-3
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 200 0
@ TALK "What!! Was it 7,000gold pieces?"
@ TALK "What are you talking about?"
@ TALK "Hmm... I can't believe I said I'd pay that much."
@ TALK "It's true I'm not clever but I'm very upset"
@ TALK "you want so much..."
@ TALK "I tell you what... I'll give you 5,000gold pieces..."
@ WAIT
@ TALK " don't be dishonest and cheat me."
@ TALK "Please be straight with me..."
@ GIVE MONEY 5000
@ REMOVE ITEM 213
@ REMOVE NUM_TO_ALL 108
@ REMOVE_ORDER 54
@ WAIT
@ END

