SELECT_END
@ END

* T3-2-1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 11 "Jeweler" 160 160 200
@ COLOR 160 160 200
@ TALK "You must be from the upper world."
@ TALK "How did you get here?"
@ TALK "Did you find a door connecting the" 
@ TALK "real and underworlds? "
@ TALK "There has always been a door for devils to get through."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "You were brought here against your will weren't you?"
