* T6-1C
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 6
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 200 250 0
@ COLOR 200 250 0
@ TALK "Everyone knows them in the underworld..."
@ TALK "Many people were kidnapped from the world "
@ TALK "and brought to the underworld. " 
@ TALK "It's not strange that so many people disappeared..."
@ TALK "the demons were hunting humans."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "According to a rule from our ancestors"
@ TALK "we should marry outside the village"
@ TALK "to ensure healthy strong descendants."
@ TALK "The same thing applies for humans and devils..."
@ TALK "So the devils made up their mind to marry humans."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "The devils kidnapped one girl who had strong"
@ TALK "magic powers"
@ TALK "and she now has children..."
@ TALK ""
@ TALK "Raegios is one of her descendents."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "As time passed it was hardly surprising that"
@ TALK "the children"
@ TALK "came to have amazing power."
@ TALK "They were usually stronger than their parents..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "But... some of the devils were jealous of their"
@ TALK "unbelievable power and a rumor was spread" 
@ TALK "that a mixed-blood person will control the world..."
@ TALK "The rumor spread so far that many devils"
@ TALK "decided to kill them."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "I heard that Raegios wasn't exactly killed"
@ TALK "by the demons..."
@ TALK "but..."
@ TALK "eventually Raegios and Raedina and their children"
@ TALK "had their power sealed so they couldn't use it."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Oh... I talked too much..." 
@ TALK "That tattoo you're wearing is the symbol of"
@ TALK "Raegios's family." 
@ GO_UP T6-1
