@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Yes... We were lucky to get it!"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 11 "Wizard Raegios" 160 160 200
@ COLOR 160 160 200
@ TALK "That's good!!!!"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "But Satan wasn't there..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 11 "Wizard Raegios" 160 160 200
@ COLOR 160 160 200
@ TALK "Maybe he is intoxicated with his victory..."
@ TALK "He is very cautious..."
@ TALK "and he lives alone somewhere nobody knows!"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "But... I know where!"
@ TALK "I'll give you a crystal key take it to" 
@ TALK "south of Soul Castle.."
@ TALK "there is a door leads to Endless Cave."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Thank you!!"
@ GIVE ITEM 241 1
@ WAIT
@ GIVE NUM_TO_ALL 72
@ NEW_OBJECT 19 46 46 1 64 44
/천귀사신을 생성시킨다.
@ END



